Using Docker with Jenkins
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure Docker on a Linux system
Set up Jenkins with Docker integration capabilities
Create Jenkins pipelines that build Docker images
Automate Docker container builds and deployments through Jenkins
Push Docker images to Docker Hub registry from Jenkins
Understand the integration between CI/CD pipelines and containerization
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with Docker concepts (containers, images, Dockerfile)
Basic knowledge of Jenkins and CI/CD concepts
Understanding of version control systems (Git)
A Docker Hub account (free registration at hub.docker.com)
