Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Docker permission denied

# Solution: Ensure Jenkins user is in docker group
sudo usermod -aG docker jenkins
sudo systemctl restart jenkins
Issue 2: Port already in use

# Solution: Stop conflicting containers
docker stop $(docker ps -q)
# Or use different ports in pipeline
Issue 3: Docker Hub authentication fails

# Solution: Verify credentials in Jenkins
# Re-create credentials with correct Docker Hub username/password
Issue 4: Pipeline fails at build stage

# Solution: Check Dockerfile syntax and dependencies
docker build -t test-image .
